# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: Data and AIFunction are disjoint. Data is what a
# function works on, not the activity itself. Without the axiom a model could
# record a training that is its own training data.
@prefix iso:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#> .
@prefix inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989/instances#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso22989/neg#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso22989/neg04> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989/instances/2.0.0> .
ex:Thing2 a iso:Data , iso:AIFunction .
